msgid ""
"Arm copter by holding the throttle down and rudder right for five seconds."
msgstr "通过将油门向下、方向舵向右保持五秒钟来解锁飞机。"

#: ../../source/docs/connect-escs-and-motors.rst:329
#: 641c281b6ed045438acf1c77c51ebda5
msgid ""
"If it fails to Arm with the throttle down and to the right and the motors "
"will not spin, it has probably failed the  Pre-Arm Safety Check."
msgstr "如果油门向下、向右时无法解锁且电机不旋转，则可能未通过解锁前安全检查。"

#: ../../source/docs/connect-escs-and-motors.rst:333
#: d307677c8d2047a6907206a0c101409f
msgid ""
"Pre-Arm safety check failure is also indicated by the red arming light "
"double flashing and then repeating."
msgstr "解锁前安全检查失败还会以红色解锁灯双闪后重复的方式指示。"

#: ../../source/docs/connect-escs-and-motors.rst:335
#: 1e918eccd8e64ca092492dbbec277f4f
msgid ""
"If the Pre-Arm check fails go to the :ref:`Prearm Safety Check Page <common-"
"prearm-safety-checks>` and correct the problem or disable the check before "
"continuing."
msgstr ""
"如果解锁前检查失败，请转至 :ref:`解锁前安全检查页面 <common-prearm-safety-checks>` "
"并解决问题，或在继续之前禁用该检查。"

#: ../../source/docs/connect-escs-and-motors.rst:338
#: c5bb0b3eaa494fbca338d5f54172d6d7
msgid ""
"When you can Arm successfully, apply a small amount of throttle, and observe"
" and note spin direction of each motor. They should match directions shown "
"in the images above for the frame you've chosen."
msgstr "成功解锁后，施加少量油门，观察并记录每个电机的旋转方向。它们应与您所选机架在上图中显示的方向一致。"

#: ../../source/docs/connect-escs-and-motors.rst:341
#: 04c7f23db04d4ddbb368dc8a217869f6
msgid "Reverse any motor spinning in the wrong direction."
msgstr "将旋转方向错误的电机反向。"

#: ../../source/docs/connect-escs-and-motors.rst:345
#: 36ded318753b46be8160cf95d47968d7
msgid "Motor Direction is reversed simply by interchanging two of the"
msgstr "电机方向的反向只需交换其中两根"

#: ../../source/docs/connect-escs-and-motors.rst:346
#: 5fbe2142f6c349a3b33494c4f12c0f09
msgid "three ESC to motor power leads."
msgstr "ESC 到电机的三根电源线即可。"

#: ../../source/docs/connect-escs-and-motors.rst:349
#: 2c13381e95174ee49087a7f6ff6ad9e2
msgid "Checking the motor numbering with the Mission Planner Motor test"
msgstr "使用 Mission Planner 电机测试检查电机编号"

#: ../../source/docs/connect-escs-and-motors.rst:351
#: ebbc8b9d90294fe6adc132cfa4f1a727
msgid ""
"An alternative way to check that the motors have been hooked up correctly is"
" to use the \"Motors\" test in the Mission Planner Initial Setup menu."
msgstr "使用 Mission Planner 初始设置菜单中的\"电机\"测试是检查电机连接是否正确的另一种方法。"

#: ../../source/docs/connect-escs-and-motors.rst:358
#: c9024eef1d7c4752977c253bd56ae32e
msgid "Mission Planner: Motor Test"
msgstr "Mission Planner：电机测试"

#: ../../source/docs/connect-escs-and-motors.rst:360
#: 4becc3d8e5b641c99f458b515ea22b96
msgid ""
"When connected to the vehicle via MAVLink, you can click on the green "
"buttons shown above and the corresponding motor should spin for five "
"seconds. Letters correspond to motor numbers as shown in the example below."
msgstr "通过 MAVLink 连接到飞行器后，点击上方显示的绿色按钮，对应的电机应旋转五秒钟。字母与电机编号的对应关系如下例所示。"

#: ../../source/docs/connect-escs-and-motors.rst:365
#: a2f222da7cf04d499d844b2dbb28b293
msgid "Take off your props first!"
msgstr "请先取下螺旋桨！"

#: ../../source/docs/connect-escs-and-motors.rst:366
#: 5a1e7752fc184fa49b822dbcd713a002
msgid ""
"If no motors turn, raise the \"Throttle %\" to 10% and try again. If that "
"doesn't work, try 15%"
msgstr "如果没有电机旋转，将\"油门 %\"提高至 10% 后再试。如果还不行，尝试 15%"

#: ../../source/docs/connect-escs-and-motors.rst:369
#: 01a31df3387f459f88354e0a7a12bdb9
msgid ""
"The first motor to spin will be the one located directly forward in the case"
" of + configuration, or the first motor to the right of straight forward in "
"the case of X configuration. The motor test will then proceed in a clockwise"
" rotation."
msgstr "第一个旋转的电机将是 + 配置中正前方的电机，或 X 配置中正前方右侧的第一个电机。之后电机测试将按顺时针方向依次进行。"

#: ../../source/docs/connect-escs-and-motors.rst:377
#: 61481f2a860b4e79a1cc7f0bf8208650
msgid ""
"In the case of X8, it will spin the top front-right motor first, then the "
"bottom front-right, and proceed around with the same pattern."
msgstr "对于 X8 机型，将先旋转右前上方电机，然后是右前下方电机，并以相同模式依次旋转。"

#: ../../source/docs/connect-escs-and-motors.rst:380
#: 1813e6e8ee7648d5841fe1b8be272775
msgid ""
"OctoV will spin the front-right motor first, and then again, proceed clock-"
"wise until reaching the front left motor."
msgstr "OctoV 将先旋转右前方电机，然后同样按顺时针方向旋转，直到左前方电机。"

#: ../../source/docs/connect-escs-and-motors.rst:384
#: 4b176921c1154f39ba405113462bf251
msgid "Using a Power Distribution Board"
msgstr "使用电源分配板"

#: ../../source/docs/connect-escs-and-motors.rst:389
#: 20f16fb2863e4f4089b4b9f47f2108c9
msgid ""
"There are two methods of connecting the motor outputs.  Either connect the "
"electronic speed controllers (ESCs) directly to the autopilot OR use a power"
" distribution board (PDB)."
msgstr "连接电机输出有两种方法：直接将电调（ESC）连接到飞控，或使用电源分配板（PDB）。"

#: ../../source/docs/connect-escs-and-motors.rst:392
#: 1a366800875e4077bf600e9920b0fee1
msgid ""
"When using a PDB, connect the power (+), ground (-), and signal (s) wires "
"for each ESC to the PDB according to motor number. Find your frame type "
"below to determine the assigned order of the motors. Then connect the signal"
" wires from the PDB to the main output signal pins on the autopilot  "
"(ensuring that the motor order numbers match the main output pin numbers on "
"the controller). If you are using a power module, it is optional to connect "
"the power and ground wires from the PDB to the autopilot board. If you would"
" like to use these cables in addition to or instead of the power module or "
"as a common point for low current servos, connect the ground (-) wire to a "
"main output ground (-) pin and the power (+) wire to a main output power (+)"
" pin."
msgstr ""
"使用 PDB 时，按电机编号将每个 ESC 的电源（+）、地线（-）和信号（s）线连接到 PDB。参考下方的机架类型确定电机分配顺序。然后将 PDB "
"的信号线连接到飞控的主输出信号引脚（确保电机编号与控制器上的主输出引脚编号一致）。如果使用电源模块，可选择是否将 PDB "
"的电源和地线连接到飞控板。如果希望将这些线缆附加于电源模块或代替电源模块使用，或作为低电流舵机的公共点，请将地线（-）连接到主输出地线（-）引脚，电源线（+）连接到主输出电源（+）引脚。"

#: ../../source/docs/connect-escs-and-motors.rst:405
#: 4761f976998d426a9f2cb07d159ac561
msgid "KDE (and other) Opto Isolated ESCs"
msgstr "KDE（及其他）光耦隔离 ESC"

#: ../../source/docs/connect-escs-and-motors.rst:407
#: 97f32ad114da48d9ae79fafc852f9fb6
msgid ""
"The KDEXF-UAS and KDEF-UASHV Series are opto-isolated and do not provide BEC"
" power output for the peripheral equipment. They require +5V to power the "
"opto-isolator and while the Pixhawk can be powered from the servo rail, it "
"does not provide +5V to the servo rail. The ESCs must be powered by a BEC or"
" with a jumper from an unused connector on the board. It is strongly "
"recommended that you use a BEC to power the rail rather than a jumper."
msgstr ""
"KDEXF-UAS 和 KDEF-UASHV 系列为光耦隔离型，不为外围设备提供 BEC 电源输出。它们需要 +5V 为光耦隔离器供电，而 "
"Pixhawk 虽可从舵机轨道供电，但不向舵机轨道提供 +5V。ESC 必须通过 BEC 供电或从板上未使用的接口通过跳线供电。强烈建议使用 BEC "
"为轨道供电，而非使用跳线。"

#: ../../source/docs/connect-escs-and-motors.rst:418
#: e02091920b934b9eb206c160102f0265
msgid ""
"The KDE ESCs have fixed PWM ranges so you must manually set the output range"
" of each PWM signal so that RCx_MIN is 1100 and RCx_MAX is 1900us using the "
"Advanced Parameter or Full Parameter Settings Page in the planner."
msgstr ""
"KDE ESC 具有固定的 PWM 范围，因此您必须使用规划器中的高级参数或完整参数设置页面手动设置每路 PWM 信号的输出范围，使 RCx_MIN 为"
" 1100，RCx_MAX 为 1900us。"

#: ../../source/docs/connect-escs-and-motors.rst:424
#: 68e6b192838d493c859e8bc4b3718095
msgid "Pixhawk ESC issues"
msgstr "Pixhawk ESC 问题"

#: ../../source/docs/connect-escs-and-motors.rst:426
#: 28c25aabd24047248a266b015f295470
msgid "Some ESCs have been reported as not working with Pixhawk."
msgstr "据报告，某些 ESC 与 Pixhawk 不兼容。"

#: ../../source/docs/connect-escs-and-motors.rst:428
#: 02cdc0874b554a0c9dfbcfe2c134e927
msgid ""
"The Pixhawk should work with every ESC that works with a normal RC receiver "
"(because it sends the same type of signal) but there is `one known "
"exception, the EMAX ESC "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/issues/2094>`__."
msgstr ""
"Pixhawk 应与所有能与普通 RC 接收机配合使用的 ESC 兼容（因为它发送的信号类型相同），但有 `一个已知的例外，即 EMAX ESC "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/issues/2094>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/connect-escs-and-motors.rst:431
#: 27e747088e8e4062b16a07c3132c6d47
msgid ""
"In most cases problems are due to incorrect wiring. Always connect signal "
"and ground. Check your ESC type to decide how to connect the +5V line. For "
"Pixhawk you must connect both the signal and the signal ground in order to "
"make the ESC work."
msgstr ""
"大多数情况下，问题是由接线错误引起的。始终连接信号线和地线。请检查您的 ESC 类型，以决定如何连接 +5V 线。对于 "
"Pixhawk，您必须同时连接信号线和信号地线才能使 ESC 正常工作。"

#: ../../source/docs/connect-escs-and-motors.rst:435
#: a69422b25f364aa6ba5b417cc3ce7406
msgid ""
"For more information see `this video <https://youtu.be/6C1YG1e2aTo>`__."
msgstr "更多信息请参见 `此视频 <https://youtu.be/6C1YG1e2aTo>`__。"
